            "review_title": "Review at Quan Bia Minh",
            "review_text": "Laura L\nChicago, Illinois406 contributions\n0\nStop by for a Bia Hoi and the view to people watch\nFeb 2020\nHot day and really just stopped by for a local Bia Hoi. Sat on the terrace and people watched, which is something even novice people watchers like me can get into. The rhythms of this city are strangely recognizable under the superficial appearance of randomness. Service a bit slow … and it was not busy. But, good local beer and viewing of life.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 14, 2020",
