            "review_text": "Jon\nRiga, Latvia81 contributions\n0\nNice location for a beer - not food\nJan 2020 • Family\nWell, the location is convenient and nice to be above street level on their balcony, but the most indifferent waitstaff we encountered in Vietnam. Couldn’t be bothered to get the order right or bring rice or bring the food out in any order that made sense. A waitress dropped a glass of wine off that wasn’t ordered and seemed upset when she was informed. Plus the food itself was plain at best - three entrees and nothing the least bit noteworthy about any of them. Overall the least enjoyable eating experience in Hanoi.\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2020",
