            "review_text": "japrestone\nReno, Nevada9 contributions\n0\nStaff are friendly and amazing place to people watch\nAug 2019 • Solo\nFirst of all the staff are awesome, really friendly, speak English and are very attentive.\nThe bia hoi is a great price for a sit down restaurant at 18,000dong. It’s cold as well.\n\nI can understand some of the comments about the food. I ordered pho bo the other day and it was very poor. \nHowever, the Nem Thit (spring rolls) were some of the best I’ve ever had. Would highly recommend.\nI like to come here for daytime drinks, spring roll snack, talk to the awesome staff, people watch and then go somewhere else for dinner.\nRead more\nWritten August 14, 2019",
