            "review_text": "farmersto\nGreater London, United Kingdom186 contributions\n0\nCan't believe this is the same place described\nAug 2019 • Couples\nWe went here for dinner after reading about the well priced Vietnamese food and excellent service mentioned in the lonely planet guide. We were expecting basic food but had thus far always enjoyed the delicious veggie dishes in this kind of place. What a mistake. The first dish of fried mushrooms with onions was a plate of onions, and the other two dishes were equally bland. By far the worst meal we have had in south east Asia. Then a rat climbed down the trellis by our table. I would honestly avoid this place and wish I had.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 6, 2019",
