            "review_text": "Stewart M\n10 contributions\n0\nBest avoided for those who appreciate good hygiene.\nAug 2019 • Couples\nWe went here for dinner. You can watch the hustle of old town from the balcony. We shared a selection of vegetarian dishes, which were pretty disappointing given the quality of vegetarian food available in Viet Nam. To crown the whole experience, a rat paid us a visit towards the end of the meal; hardly the ideal digestif and it cast the generally grubby state of the place in a new, even less flattering light. Best avoided if you like to eat or drink in places that are clean.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 6, 2019",
